      "case_id": "healthReady.readyDespiteFailure",
      "operation_id": "healthReady",
      "kind": "invalid_response",
      "why": "A handler computing status from a stale value would advertise a half-migrated deployment as serving, and every probe reading only status would route traffic to it. A conforming client must refuse this.",
